%table{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; width: 100%; background-color: #f7f8f8; margin: 0; padding: 0;", :width => "100%"}
  %tr
    %td{:align => "center", :style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 24px 16px;", :valign => "top"}
      %table{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;", :width => "100%"}
        %tr
          %td{:align => "center", :style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 32px 24px 0;", :valign => "top"}
            = image_tag "http://www.nascenia.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/Nascenia.png", :width => "180", :style => "margin-bottom: 8px;"
        %tr
          %td{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 24px 24px 0;", :valign => "top"}
            %p{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; color: #333;"}
              Hello #{@resource.name.presence || @resource.email},
            %p{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 0; color: #555; line-height: 1.6;"}
              We have received a request to reset the password for your Timetracker Application account. Click the button below to create a new password.
        %tr
          %td{:align => "center", :style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 4px 24px 24px;", :valign => "top"}
            %p{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #888; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"}
              This request is valid for 7 minutes. Please complete the password reset within this time.
        %tr
          %td{:align => "center", :style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 0 24px 24px;", :valign => "top"}
            %a{:href => edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), :style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 15px; background-color: #2563eb; border-radius: 6px; color: #fff; display: inline-block; font-weight: 600; padding: 13px 28px; text-decoration: none; line-height: 1.4;"}
              Reset Password
        %tr
          %td{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 0 24px 24px;", :valign => "top"}
            %p{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 8px; padding: 0; color: #888; line-height: 1.5;"}
              If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste the following link into your browser:
            %p{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 0; padding: 0; color: #2563eb; word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.5;"}
              = edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token)
        %tr
          %td{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 0 24px 24px;", :valign => "top"}
            %hr{:style => "border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; margin: 20px 0;"}
            %p{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #999; line-height: 1.5;"}
              If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. Your password won't change until you access the link above and create a new one.
      %p{:style => "font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; margin: 16px 0 0; padding: 0; color: #999; text-align: center;"}
        Copyright &copy; Leave Tracker | Nascenia #{Time.now.year}
